<title>USA: Reading &amp; Bates in deep water technology pact.</title>
<headline>Reading &amp; Bates in deep water technology pact.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reading &amp; Bates Development Co said Monday it agreed with Cal Dive International to pursue jointly the development of technology to address growing requirements for subsea well intervention services and subsea facilities construction in deep water.</p>
<p>The Reading &amp; Bates Corp subsidiary said the companies will seek term contracts to provide these services and will consider providing new vessels to fulfill such contracts.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
